BT /F1 10 Tf 40 760 Td 14 TL (Postmortem: March 10 payment delays \(INC-2231\)) Tj T* (Author: Payments Core team. Published March 17, 2026.) Tj T* (Summary: card payments were delayed for 3 hours and 10 minutes on March 10, 2026.) Tj T* (In total 18,000 payments were delayed.) Tj T* (Root causes: change CHG-1052 enabled fraud-scoring model v3, whose latency was far higher in) Tj T* (production than in staging, and change CHG-1047 had reduced the payment-gateway connection pool to 50.) Tj T* (Affected services: payment-gateway, fraud-check, checkout-api. The ledger-service was not affected.) Tj T* (Action items: load-test fraud models before release; alert when the gateway pool is above 80 percent;) Tj T* (require Payments Core review for pool size changes.) Tj T* ET
endstream
